":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199561},{"name":"salazarje1/SpringboardExercise","owner":"salazarje1","html_url":"https://github.com/salazarje1/SpringboardExercise","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199564},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App.  Acceptance Criteria GIVEN a single-page application portfolio for a web developer WHEN I load the portfolio THEN I am presented with a page containing a header, a section for content, and a footer WHEN I view the header THEN I am presented with the developer's name and navigation with titles corresponding to different sections of the portfolio WHEN I view the navigation titles THEN I am presented with the titles About Me, Portfolio, Contact, and Resume, and the title corresponding to the current section is highlighted WHEN I click on a navigation title THEN I am presented with the corresponding section below the navigation without the page reloading and that title is highlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199568},{"name":"taylorepskamp/detector","owner":"taylorepskamp","html_url":"https://github.com/taylorepskamp/detector","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199569},{"name":"arielbs1991/southern-diner","owner":"arielbs1991","html_url":"https://github.com/arielbs1991/southern-diner","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Find all the information you need for Shelly's Southern Diner in Burien, here!","topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199577},{"name":"cdrmr18/my-weather-app","owner":"cdrmr18","html_url":"https://github.com/cdrmr18/my-weather-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"weather project for shecodes","topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199585},{"name":"stripedpajamas/one-forty-four","owner":"stripedpajamas","html_url":"https://github.com/stripedpajamas/one-forty-four","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199593},{"name":"Merkraith/Dragon-City-Resource","owner":"Merkraith","html_url":"https://github.com/Merkraith/Dragon-City-Resource","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2194,"global_rank":199594},{"name":"Merkraith/Home-Inventory-App","owner":"Merkraith","html_url":"https://github.com/Merkraith/Home-Inventory-App","stars":0,"for